[34.802, "o", "needs decision: /Users/damian/.claude/jobs/15df1d51/tmp/demo-run/shop uses rust (2 files), json (1 file), typescript (1 file), which have no language pack installed. Install them so reviews are syntax highlighted?\r\n  --languages rust,json,typescript (default) \u00b7 download and install these packs on the hub\r\n  --languages none \u00b7 show these files as plain text; mg lang add installs packs later\r\nre-run with --languages set to the chosen option\r\n"]
