[72.416, "o", "installed the mergegate skill in /Users/damian/.claude/jobs/15df1d51/tmp/demo-run/mg-home/skill/mergegate\r\n  SKILL.md\r\n  references/setup.md\r\n  references/authoring.md\r\n  references/waiting.md\r\n  references/operator.md\r\n\r\nCopy or link the folder to where you load skills from. Then ask your operator what to do with an item's branch after it merges: mergegate squash-merges, so git still sees the branch as unmerged. The default is `git switch --detach` then `git branch -D <branch>`. Record what you agree where you keep your standing instructions.\r\n"]
